{"server":"cn","storyId":"story_saga_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_saga_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"未必空","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_saga_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"315414ff1e23e8d1ac74fd44dee613e975b6775fae2baeab7554c35c5be8f6a9","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_outcounty"},{"type":"narration","text":"却说那东国云游僧嵯峨，这日离了百灶，向西南悠悠而行。\n行出百余里，回首已不见炎都城影辙痕。又天色渐暮，忽见南方隐有房屋掩映。\n行到近处，只见得荒村一座，屋舍坍圮，草木蔓生，井渠淤塞，门前苔深。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_yanshabbyroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"avg_362_saga_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这间房子还算完整......还带个小园呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"avg_362_saga_1","isRemote":false,"text":"村子虽然荒了，但看得出原本道路和房子井井有条，应当也曾是富庶的村落......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"avg_362_saga_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不知道又是为什么荒废了......天灾、航线、驰道，还是别的呢......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"春夜风软，带着些寒意。双月冷光透过旧窗，洒在嵯峨面前，窗棂投下的阴影纹样俨然，和更模糊些的树影融成一片斑驳。\n嵯峨靠在窗下，想着草木春秋，人事代谢，不自觉拿手去拨那影子，指尖刚触到地面，便听见一声怪响——\n指头下的影子似乎也跟着一抖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"avg_362_saga_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦......光顾着看这房子，忘了自己的五脏庙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"avg_362_saga_1","isRemote":false,"text":"百灶人对食物真是讲究，干粮都有这么多花样，贪新鲜买多了，先吃哪一样好呢......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"avg_362_saga_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最普通的调味干粮闻起来就很香，还有五色谷物粗粉、真空豆腐卷饼、自热脱水杂菌饭......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"嵯峨一边念着，一边细听墙外的响动，身子贴着窗下，悄然向房门边挪去。\n正欲探出门，却被笃笃两声叩响阻断了动作——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"打、打扰了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"avg_362_saga_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——不打扰、不打扰，这屋子的门窗就剩个框了，施主既然愿意与小僧交谈，还请现身便是。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"一墙之隔，那脚步声顿了一顿。\n接着，一只手扶住门框，月光映得手腕雪白；裙摆窸窣间，迈入一位韶龄菲林少女，杏眼鸦发，脸上带着些微怯色。\n嵯峨鼻翼翕动，似乎闻到豌豆花的清香，未曾留意，这荒园里竟还长了豆藤吗......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲林少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"这位......小僧姐姐，是自百灶而来？"},{"type":"narration","text":"呃......\n不错，小僧出身东国，在大炎云游已久，前几日刚刚离开百灶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"avg_362_saga_1","isRemote":false,"text":"施主......是这里的主人吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲林少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"咦？......这院落一眼便知荒废多时，我如何可能住在这里呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"avg_362_saga_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小僧也正想呢，一般不是该有些障眼法，把瓦砾变成殿阁，露水变成菜肴，风声变成乐声吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲林少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"什么障眼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲林少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，你把我当成什么了？！我、我是正经人家女儿，只是路过这里，同你一样借宿一晚而已！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_yanshabbyroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"avg_362_saga_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......原来施主是尚蜀人士，前往百灶途中迷路，才在这里徘徊吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小玉","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"不错，我家姓袁，世居攥江峰下。我单名为玉，小僧姐姐唤我小玉便是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小玉","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"这番上京，是想要往天师府寻一位......有恩于我家的天师。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"avg_362_saga_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这么说，小玉施主上京是为了报恩？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小玉","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"报恩......也谈不上。只是......嗯，我家因为家资丰厚，曾被盗匪盯上，是那位天师路过出手，救下家人性命......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小玉","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"父亲母亲都是重义之人，感激天师的恩情，又......恰逢新岁，便寄去了书信和土产问候。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小玉","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"可......包裹寄去后便了无音信，不知是不是寄丢了。父母年迈，我不愿见父母为此牵挂忧心......便想自己走一趟百灶，拜谢天师。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小玉","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"没承想到了百灶近处，却不见城影......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"avg_362_saga_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原来如此。本月百灶正在巡航，小玉施主找不到方位，大概是弄错了停驻点吧？小僧去姜齐时也犯过这个错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小玉","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"巡航......？唔，小僧姐姐刚离了百灶，我原不该有此冒昧一问，只是......只是我初次离乡，凭我一人，实难寻到百灶所在......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小玉","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"若不至误了小僧姐姐的行程，可否挈带我至百灶，拜谒天师府......只要能抵达百灶，小玉必当倾囊以谢......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"avg_362_saga_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小玉施主不愧是尚蜀闺秀，说起话来文绉绉的......好在不是刚到炎国那阵子了，不然还真怕听不明白......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"avg_362_saga_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这有什么耽误的，小僧四方云游，并没有固定的去处。离开百灶才几天，回去追上也不难，小僧护送你上京便是，不用酬谢什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小玉","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"这怎么好呢？从小父亲母亲便教我知恩须图报，若非小僧姐姐愿携我同往，我迷失于荒野，性命也不知能不能保全......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小玉","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"如此恩情，当然要诚心报答。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小玉","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"小僧姐姐可有喜爱之物？抑或行旅之中可有需要的物什？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"avg_362_saga_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小僧行李很齐全，并没有什么需要——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小玉","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"小僧姐姐一再推辞，可是不相信我是诚心报答的么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"avg_362_saga_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊呀，并非、并非如此，只是小僧向来孑然一身，该有的也都有了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"avg_362_saga_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（......怎么觉得，小玉施主还是有些奇怪......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小玉","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"难道说，小僧姐姐不信我，仍当我是山野精怪么......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"avg_362_saga_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"avg_362_saga_1","isRemote":false,"text":"施主哪里话，小僧这是、小僧并未......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小玉","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"呜......那小僧姐姐是怪我多心了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"avg_362_saga_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小僧、小僧——啊呀，那、那待到了百灶，小玉施主请小僧吃一顿斋饭......就可以了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小玉","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"原来小僧姐姐喜欢美食呀，是了，刚才便听你数那百灶带出来的干粮呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"avg_362_saga_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是因为听见了小玉施主饥肠辘......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小玉","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"原、原来你听到了！那也不好当着我面说出来呀，哎呀......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"avg_362_saga_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小玉","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"小僧姐姐，怎么不说话了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"avg_362_saga_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......小僧只怕又说错话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小玉","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"......噗。对不住，是我不好，自小便爱和人话赶话，邻家妹妹也常怪我，有次被我说得急了，差点扔掉我的......我的什么来着......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小玉","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"说远了......总之，我给小僧姐姐赔罪啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"avg_362_saga_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这，哎呀......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"avg_362_saga_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......那小玉施主，要吃干粮吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_outcounty"},{"type":"narration","text":"数日后"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小玉","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"小僧姐姐，我有些脚疼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"avg_362_saga_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不妨事，也快到中午了，我们休息一下再走吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小玉","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......不知到了百灶，能不能顺利入访天师府呢......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"avg_362_saga_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小玉施主既有正当事由，按规矩登记通报便是。听小玉施主讲的，那位天师也是热心好义之人，想来不会拒人于门外。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小玉","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"......是。只是我怕通传不便，又或者我这点琐屑事务，根本不予通传呢......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小玉","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"若我有小僧姐姐这般本领就好了......几日同行，才知小僧姐姐不仅心地仁慈，更兼武艺高强，教人钦羡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"avg_362_saga_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......武艺只为防身。世间多有繁难事，并非武勇能够解决。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小玉","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"如小僧姐姐这般有武艺之人，自然可以这样说。可我们寻常人，只盼多一分力量，遇事才多一点办法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小玉","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"若我不是那般年幼，自己能有一身本领，又怎么......又怎么需要倚仗天师偶发善心，才能护得家人周全呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"avg_362_saga_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小玉施主家遭盗匪，原来是年幼时的事......？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"avg_362_saga_1","isRemote":false,"text":"听小玉施主这样说，小僧忽然有一个想法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"avg_362_saga_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然小玉施主与那位天师有缘，又向往天师的本领，何不去应天师府之试？学成天师之艺，能护下的便不只是家人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小玉","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"——我、我？我怎么可能去......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小玉","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"失礼......小僧姐姐金玉良言，我会用心思量的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小玉","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，水壶空了，左右是在歇脚，烧点水再走如何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小玉","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"能求小僧姐姐帮忙生火么？说来不好意思，野外奔波，原本离不得火，我却总有些畏火......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小玉","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"我呢......就去打水吧，记得方才路过了溪流。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"avg_362_saga_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小玉施主的脚不疼了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小玉","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"那，小僧姐姐的耳朵借我摸一下？小时和兄长踏青，我走累了哭闹，他就让我摸摸耳朵，好像真有用哦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"avg_362_saga_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，这恐怕有些......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小玉","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"呵呵，真不经逗呢。我去啦。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_forest"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小玉","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"这溪流边还有蒲公英......不如采一些回去。火都生了，干嘛只烧个水呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小玉","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"对岸也有......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小玉","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，那处窄，还有块石头可以踏......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小玉","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"这石头......这石头怎么会动？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小玉","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？这么大的钳兽？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小玉","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"救、救命......小僧姐姐......！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1626_1","isRemote":false,"text":"姑娘莫慌！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1626_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......等等、你......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1626_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不管了！先——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1626_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊啊啊我的脚————"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小玉","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"啊啊啊它它它在夹你的脚——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_outcounty"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陌生少年","speakerId":"avg_npc_1626_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多谢这位师父相救......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"avg_362_saga_1","isRemote":false,"text":"举手之劳。不过，小兄弟怎么把那钳兽的尸身拖过来了......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陌生少年","speakerId":"avg_npc_1626_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？趁着还新鲜，赶紧把腹肉螯肉拆出来吃掉，不然多浪费啊！哈哈！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小玉","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？这么大的钳兽......能吃？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天师学徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1626_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然能了——啊，还未报上姓名，我姓李，是名天师学徒，在天师府读农科。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天师学徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1626_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这只钳兽体型虽大，但钳兽结构都差不多，小的能拆壳取肉，大的当然也能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天师学徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1626_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们这不是水都烧上了——我就是看到你们生火的烟气才走近来，没想到正好碰到......这位姑娘遇险。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小玉","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"天、天师......？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"avg_362_saga_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原来是小李天师，失敬。小僧名叫嵯峨，自东国而来，正在大炎云游。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小玉","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"我......姓袁名玉，是尚蜀人士，上京途中迷路了，幸赖小僧姐姐携我同行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天师学徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1626_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小玉","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"小李天师......现下也是要去百灶？可是要回天师府......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天师学徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1626_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......正是正是，我出京取一份很珍贵的样株，正要返程。反正......你们也是去百灶，我们，结个伴？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"avg_362_saga_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小玉施主，真是好运。你忧心的事，不如就拜托小李天师......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天师学徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1626_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？什么事......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小玉","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......没什么，一点小事情。到了百灶再说吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小玉","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"小李天师刚才说的“养朱”，可是天师法宝么？我从小听话本，都说天师们有千般神通，百般法宝，只是从没亲眼见过......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天师学徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1626_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，谈不上法宝，只是我在天师府这么多年，也从没见养得这么完美的......我拿给你们看看吧！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小玉","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，我、我只是想瞧瞧天师的法宝，失礼了......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"avg_362_saga_1","isRemote":false,"text":"少见小玉施主这么冒失呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天师学徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1626_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没事没事！这包里确实没什么法宝。只有这个，这可是好东西哇——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"avg_362_saga_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"avg_362_saga_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这，这不是个发霉的橘子吗......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天师学徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1626_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对呀！你看这菌，长得多茁壮，多漂亮......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天师学徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1626_1","isRemote":false,"text":"师兄的论文有救了呢......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_campsite_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"avg_362_saga_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......小玉施主。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小玉","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"——呃，我、我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"avg_362_saga_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小玉施主手上，是小李天师的包吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小玉","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小玉","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"我不是要盗他钱财，只是......想借一样东西，之后会好好还回去的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"avg_362_saga_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小玉施主，是想“借”天师府的出入凭证？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小玉","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"avg_362_saga_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先前小僧便思索，小玉施主为何不愿对小李天师道出此行目的呢？若担心无人通传，托小李天师寻人，不是正好吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"avg_362_saga_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小玉施主，似乎一直都想亲身进入天师府，甚至不惜要偷小李天师的行李......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"avg_362_saga_1","isRemote":false,"text":"敢问，小玉施主去天师府，究竟是要做什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"avg_362_saga_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小玉施主要找的那位天师，又到底是你的什么人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小玉","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"......小僧姐姐既然这样问，便是知道了......那又何须再问？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"avg_362_saga_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......世间事，能教人奋不顾身至此的，无非那么几桩。"},{"type":"narration","text":"既非报恩......\n便是寻仇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小玉","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"narration","text":"嵯峨伸出手，无言点上小玉眉心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"avg_362_saga_1","isRemote":false,"text":"施主慎之。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小玉","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"......我知道小僧姐姐慈悲心肠，必定要阻拦我。可我全家都被那个天师所害，此生只余下这一个念头，必要仇人偿命，使家人瞑目！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"avg_362_saga_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"avg_362_saga_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小玉施主，大炎律法甚严，若确是天师害人，何不向三法司报案，炎律定会给你个交代，何苦要将自己搭进去？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小玉","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"我......可我其实，连那天师姓甚名谁都不知道，如何报案......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小玉","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"况且，官是官，民是民，话本子里那样多悬案，若非结识奇人英雄、青天贤臣，我一个孤女，怎么告得赢天师呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"avg_362_saga_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小玉施主此言差矣。一家遇害，定是一桩大案，即使不知凶手姓名，三法司也不可能姑息，只要拿出证据，天师也不能不伏法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小玉","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"证据......可我没有证据......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"avg_362_saga_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那小玉施主为什么认定是天师所为？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小玉","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"我......我记得！我记得她的样子......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小玉","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"还有......遍地的血......流过我膝下......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小玉","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"我醒来......就在重重瓦砾下，家破楼空，连家人尸身都寻不见......这都是在她......我见到她之后......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小玉","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"若不是天师，谁有这样的神通？若不是她害了我全家，还能是谁？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"avg_362_saga_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......小玉施主说不知天师姓名，那你是在何时何地遇见她的，是年幼时？是成人后？是废墟？是家中？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小玉","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"是......是......应当是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小玉","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"可我知道是她！我就是......知道！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"avg_362_saga_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你亲见得她杀人吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小玉","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小玉","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"可我分明就是寻着她去的......我还看见了......很多死人......只剩下我一个......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"avg_362_saga_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小玉施主方才不是说，没有找到家人的尸身？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小玉","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"尸身......对了......不、不对......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"avg_362_saga_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......唉。小玉施主莫慌，小僧不该问得这么急，人受了大惊吓，记忆混乱也是常有的事......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小玉","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"......我家，有几口人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小玉","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"十一......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小玉","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"......还是五百？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"avg_362_saga_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_campsite_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"avg_362_saga_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小玉施主......你呆坐半晌，可想清楚些了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小玉","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"avg_362_saga_1","isRemote":false,"text":"恕小僧冒昧，小玉施主......究竟是什么出身？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小玉","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"......你是不是，又在当我是精怪了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小玉","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我姓袁，家住攥江峰下，有父母双亲，有兄嫂姐姐......窗下的芭蕉长了几片叶子，我都一一记得清楚！我来历分明，怎么会是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小玉","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"可那片血沼荒野......到底又是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小玉","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"小僧姐姐！你捏捏我，你碰碰我，我是热的，心还在跳，会饥会渴，我......我不可能是话本子里的鬼吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"avg_362_saga_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......小僧这些年，也有诸多奇遇，可志怪故事里那样的荒魂幽鬼，一个也不曾见过。想来这大地之上确是没有鬼魂的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"avg_362_saga_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小玉施主......你一直说你记得分明，究竟是记得些什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小玉","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"......我记得，我像是，和家中失散......追着他们而去......只找到一片血腥之地......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小玉","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"我记得......我生在攥江峰下，家人都疼爱我，自小无忧无虑......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小玉","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"我爱听话本故事......常与东邻妹妹玩耍......她梳两个角髻，九岁那年五月五，我送了她一条五色发绳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小玉","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"我有一样珍爱之物......就养在西窗之下，案台之上，妆镜之......侧......乃是......是......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天师学徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1626_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天师学徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1626_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天师学徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1626_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是一粒豆子么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“小玉”","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_campsite_n"},{"type":"narration","text":"姓李的天师学徒叹了口气，取出一张黄符，贴在“小玉”心口，符纸上些许笔画便浮起微光。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“小玉”","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"这......这是何意？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天师学徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1626_1","isRemote":false,"text":"灵符既验，你确是天师府之物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天师学徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1626_1","isRemote":false,"text":"乃是......一粒豆兵。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_yanshabbyroom"},{"type":"narration","text":"豌豆花香。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g05_mountaincity_d"},{"type":"narration","text":"“攥江峰”下。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_yanshabbyroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小玉","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"......自小便爱和人话赶话，邻家妹妹也常怪我，有次被我说得急了，差点扔掉我的......我的什么来着......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_outcounty"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小玉","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"......我却总有些畏火......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_campsite_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"avg_362_saga_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......小僧是觉得前后有些蹊跷，可......“豆兵”......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天师学徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1626_1","isRemote":false,"text":"此乃天师所使的“撒豆成兵”之法。农院至忙时，偶尔便会点一队豆兵来帮忙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天师学徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1626_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但话说回来......豆兵通常都长得一个样子，无知无识，行动时间也不长，更不会自以为有家人来历。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天师学徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1626_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然符纸检测无疑，但......小玉姑娘恐怕是另有奇遇，才会是如今这般形象，并有了这些驳杂记忆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"avg_362_saga_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“驳杂记忆”......？小玉施主的记忆确实有些混乱，但我原以为只是......或许只是，受了些刺激......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天师学徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1626_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你们动静实在不小，我早醒了，事情我也听了个七七八八。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天师学徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1626_1","isRemote":false,"text":"农业天师用豆兵是做农活不错，但这术法既然叫“撒豆成兵”，原本自然是用于干戈之事......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天师学徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1626_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我听小玉姑娘所言，那“与家中失散”之事，恐怕是在施术天师点兵时被漏下了，凭着本能追去......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天师学徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1626_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所谓血沼，大约就是应到的战场吧。估计是到得晚了，只见到一地狼藉......又被战场血气一激，便化回了豆形吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天师学徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1626_1","isRemote":false,"text":"按常理，几天后术法散尽，豆兵也就委于尘泥了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“小玉”","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天师学徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1626_1","isRemote":false,"text":"却不知道为何到了那袁姓小姑娘手里......或许是被打扫战场的人捡走送人了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天师学徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1626_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不知那小姑娘怎么养护你的，让那豆中术法余波残存不绝，还影响了你的意识......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天师学徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1626_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我听你一直说话本里如何如何，可是那小袁姑娘爱听话本，天天说与你听？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“小玉”","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天师学徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1626_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我猜你一心想上京，是因为话本里的故事常常如此吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“小玉”","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"......不。应当是因为......小玉后来嫁给邻家，丈夫过了考校，她随丈夫上京去了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“小玉”","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是一直......忘了这一截。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天师学徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1626_1","isRemote":false,"text":"噢噢噢！说得通说得通。小玉姑娘你还挺能编的，虽说记忆零散，这绕来绕去，还是把这么多事都串起来了嘛！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“小玉”","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“小玉”","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"那我......为什么现在会成了小玉的样子？豆兵......不是无知无识么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天师学徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1626_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我倒是更奇怪你都化回豆了，只凭一个小姑娘的供养，怎么还能再化人形？还能活动这么久，有这种强度的自我意识......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天师学徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1626_1","isRemote":false,"text":"若不是符纸确认了你是天师术法产物，只看外表言行，你倒更像是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天师学徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1626_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，没什么没什么，这个说不得。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"avg_362_saga_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（......“攥江峰”，要是记得不错，上回在罗德岛遇到夕和鲤先生他们，说起的就是这个地方......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天师学徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1626_1","isRemote":false,"text":"总而言之，你恐怕是把自己当成了那小袁姑娘，又把那诸多记忆混成了一个奇情故事，以为自己身负血仇，才一心只想上京报仇吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“小玉”","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“小玉”","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"......原来我......果真不是......怎么会......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“小玉”","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"......这仇，根本就报无可报？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天师学徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1626_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这不是好事嘛！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"avg_362_saga_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"avg_362_saga_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小李天师，小僧......另有一事求问。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"avg_362_saga_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然小玉施主是这样的来历......天师府要怎么安排她？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天师学徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1626_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嵯峨师父，我知道你想说什么。但这毕竟是天师府之物，又有种种特异，绝无可能让它在外游荡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“小玉”","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“小玉”","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"......李天师，我......能不能再求一件事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天师学徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1626_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你还想求什么？你那套故事......刚才不是都捋明白了嘛，就没有那么回事，只是你拼凑补缀，想当然而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“小玉”","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"我并无他意，只是想，能不能在去天师府之前，先见过一个人......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“小玉”","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"虽是我想当然......却也不是无中生有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“小玉”","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"李天师不是也说，若不是那人养护我，我早就是血污之中一团泥了......既然我现在站在这里，此事总不会有假......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“小玉”","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"可我......都没和她说过一句话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天师学徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1626_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天师学徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1626_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你用这个样子去见她，也不太好吧......何必执着这些呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“小玉”","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"我可以遮掩形貌，也不会同她讲我是什么，只是......想谢谢她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“小玉”","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"......“知恩须图报”的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天师学徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1626_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"avg_362_saga_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"avg_362_saga_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小李天师，常言“人非草木，孰能无情”，小玉施主现今唯有此愿......人，总不至比草木更无情？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"avg_362_saga_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小僧也求你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天师学徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1626_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......你们这......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天师学徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1626_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"31_g1_luo_park"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“小玉”","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“小玉”","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"“显妣袁玉之墓”......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“小玉”","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"原来......已经过去这么久了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“小玉”","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"难怪醒来的时候，宅院都荒败成那样了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“小玉”","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"我还以为，至少有一样不是我妄自编成的梦幻......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“小玉”","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"原来，也早就成空了呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"avg_362_saga_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小玉施主......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“小玉”","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"小僧姐姐，多谢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“小玉”","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"我终究......报答不了谁的恩情。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"话音落下，一阵淡淡华光泛起，并不耀眼，却教嵯峨不自觉阖了眼睛。\n再睁开时，只见掌心躺着一粒豆，质坚如玉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天师学徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1626_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"avg_362_saga_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小李天师，小僧还有一问。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"avg_362_saga_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们......当真是偶遇吗？天师学徒，个个都会随身携带那种符纸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天师学徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1626_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......唉。它一个天师术法产物，贸贸然靠近百灶，天师府岂能毫无所察？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天师学徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1626_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我本来想，你们偶然相遇，你又全不知情，不如就稳妥走完这一程。等你们道了别，我悄悄把它带回天师府就是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"avg_362_saga_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这位袁玉之事，你也早就知晓？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天师学徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1626_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那倒不是。我只是知道，它不能如愿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天师学徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1626_1","isRemote":false,"text":"上一次尚蜀有战事，还有天师出征的，早是百年前了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天师学徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1626_1","isRemote":false,"text":"豆兵原本无知无识，可这一粒，有了这点意识，一番奇遇，一番挣扎......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天师学徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1626_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只徒然从尚蜀走了一趟百灶，千难万难，不过是发现自己一切成空。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天师学徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1626_1","isRemote":false,"text":"何苦呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"avg_362_saga_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......曾有人对小僧说，我看画中人，自以为“真人”看“假人”，焉知我辈不是画中人，一生行路，不过是某个执笔之人的一时兴起......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"avg_362_saga_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小僧时时忆起这番话......今日亦然。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"avg_362_saga_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小李天师，你说小玉施主徒然受苦，到头不过发现自己是一场空。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"avg_362_saga_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小僧却在想......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"avg_362_saga_1","isRemote":false,"text":"未必是空。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天师学徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1626_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不论如何周折，这个结局都不会变。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天师学徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1626_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你又能做什么呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"avg_362_saga_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小玉施主给了自己一个故事，为了这故事跋涉千里，小僧既然陪伴了她一程，便为她......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"avg_362_saga_1","isRemote":false,"text":"记下这个故事吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
